The cosmopsychogram was developed jointly by REINHOLD and Dr.BAL-
DUR EBERTin.Its basis is explained in detail and substantiated with nu-
merous illustrations in "Die kosmischen Grundlagen unseres Lebens'.Its
use pre-dates the introduction of structural-elements in chart analysis and
in setting up the cosmopsychogram somewhat larger orbs are used for
aspects.Examples E/8 and E/9 show two quite dissimiliar cosmopsycho-
grams.The cosmopsychogram show in the form of a seventeen rayed dia-
gram the results obtained by evaluating the structural-elements of a chart
according to a fixed key.The bottom four rays show the individual's "type-
composition"i.e.their proportion of tension and relaxation,and of inward
and outward interest (their tendency to introversion or extroversion) 。The
type-composition is based upon the sign positions of the individual horo-
scopic factors.
The middle circle of the cosmopsychogram show the distance-value of
each heavenly body.This is based upon its distance from the earth,from
value O for apogee to 100 at perigee.(Distance-value ephemerides for all
years from 1881 are available from the publishers.)
Each of the 13 birth chart factors is represented by a ray on the cosmo-
psychogram.The white inner portion of each ray is its positive value and
the black outer portion its negative value.The length of the ray is determined
by avaluating the factors mid-points and aspects according to a fixed key.
The total white section is defined as the positive"kernel"and the total black
section as the negative "mantle".If we compare the two cases E/8 and E/9
it is immediately apparent that in E/8 there is a very large positive kernel
and a weaknegative mantle,whilst in E/9 on the other hand there is a smaller
positive kernel and a very muchlarger negative mantle.Furthermore whilst
E/8 gives an unbroken and coherant impression E/9 appears ragged and dis-
jointed.The actual case histories of these two cases are as follows:E/8 is
the psychocosmogram of a "happy and successful woman"who has always
achieved her aims in life and prospered whilst E/9 is the psychocosmogram
of an extremely sickly individual.He was a forceps delivery and has suffered
paralysis since birth and has had to spend his life in a home for the handi-
capped.(Further details of these cases can be found in the above mentioned
book.)Anyone who thoroughly studies cosmopsychograms willfind confirma-
tion of their excellence as tools for the scientific comparison of birth charts.
