                          General Remarks
96)The observation and research of illness requires a great deal of care
and tact.The author has been particularly careful in all of his statements.
No-one should be tempted to give a diagnosis on the basis of the cosmio
picture alone because itis impossible as somany factors add to the situation
which is shown in the chart,but which can only be released under special
circumstances.These cannot be forseen from the chart.One should always
consider that Biological Correspondences which are based on co-operation
with doctors.The Biological Correspondences can become effective through
various circumstances.One must always be very very careful in interpret-
ing disease.
97)Those who work on cosmobiology must be constantly aware that it is non-
sense to read the destiny from the stars alone.It is also important to have
some knowledge of psychology and medicine and a rich experience of life if
one wants to help not only one's own family but others too.With every word
spoken by the cosmobiological investigator one should be conscious of the
responsibility and the damaging consequences which the wrong words could
have.One does not help others by making them afraid of the future but must
use every opportunity to build up their self confidence and their self-
consciousness of their own value.
Those who advise other should always remember that it is not for them to
bring about a decision in the life of another.It is for the cosmobiologist to
give help and build up confidence in others so that they can make their own
decisions for themselves to the best of their ability.




